Route39_Interior1_Text_Woman3_1::
	.string "Our milk even goes out to KANTO.\p"
	.string "So if our own MILTANK won’t give\n"
	.string "us any milk, we’re in trouble.$"

Route39_Interior1_Text_Woman3_2::
	.string "That there’s REST.\p"
	.string "It’s a rare move that puts your\n"
	.string "POKéMON to sleep but it recovers\l"
	.string "health.\p"
	.string "You best think how you ought to use\n"
	.string "it, hon.$"

Route39_Interior1_Text_Woman3_3::
	.string "You fixed our MILTANK, hon. Now\n"
	.string "it gives MOOMOO MILK again.\p"
	.string "Here’s somethin’ fer your trouble.$"

Route39_Interior1_Text_BaldingMan_1::
	.string "My MILTANK ain’t givin’ me milk\n"
	.string "nomore.\p"
	.string "This here FARM’s got famous milk.\n"
	.string "Most everyone wants a drink.\p"
	.string "It’ll give me lots o’ milk if’n I\n"
	.string "feed it lots o’ ORAN BERRIES,\l"
	.string "I reckon.$"

Route39_Interior1_Text_BaldingMan_2::
	.string "How’d you like my MOOMOO MILK?\p"
	.string "It’s my pride and joy, son.\p"
	.string "Give it to POKéMON to restore HP!\p"
	.string "I’ll give it to ya fer just  500.$"

Route39_Interior1_Text_BaldingMan_3::
	.string "You don’t want it?\n"
	.string "Come again, hear?$"

Route39_Interior1_Text_BaldingMan_4::
	.string "I best go do my milkin’.$"

Route39_Interior1_Text_BaldingMan_5::
	.string "Here ya go!\n"
	.string "Drink up’n enjoy!$"

Route39_Interior1_Text_BaldingMan_6::
	.string "Sorry, son. No cash, no sale!$"
